
	The Earth Lords (Unregistered) History

	History Report Begins Sunday, June 19th, 1994

	1. Fixed a bug where nondamage combat spells could be cast infinitely.
	
	2. Fixed bug about only being able to turn undead once per session.
	
	3. Hopefully fixed combat message of killing last opponent twice.
	
	4. Found a typo which prevented opponent 4 from being hit by spells
	when more than one opponent was in the group.
	
	5. Added a fix where you no longer recieve gold when killing
	flying creatures. However, magical items may still be recieved.

	